---
title: "01 / Target system architecture"
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Planned Mandelbrot render farm architecture
    accDescr: Each of three coordinators contains a persistent Raft log and its own replica of the durable task queue. The scheduler reads pending tasks from its local queue. Raft replicates commands, and each coordinator applies committed commands to its queue. Workers communicate with the leader. Accepted grids are read from the durable queue for image assembly.

    UI["User / Web UI<br/>Submit jobs and view progress"]

    subgraph RAFT["ONE LOGICAL DURABLE TASK QUEUE - replicated inside three coordinators"]
        direction LR

        subgraph CA["Coordinator A - current leader"]
            direction TB
            A["Scheduler + Raft<br/>Persistent log"]
            QA[("Durable task queue - replica A<br/>PENDING / RUNNING / COMPLETED / FAILED<br/>Attempts, leases and accepted grids")]
            A -->|"Apply committed commands"| QA
            QA -.->|"Read pending tasks, leases and results"| A
        end

        subgraph CB["Coordinator B - follower"]
            direction TB
            B["Raft follower<br/>Persistent log"]
            QB[("Durable task queue - replica B<br/>Same committed task history<br/>Attempts, leases and accepted grids")]
            B -->|"Apply committed commands"| QB
        end

        subgraph CC["Coordinator C - follower"]
            direction TB
            C["Raft follower<br/>Persistent log"]
            QC[("Durable task queue - replica C<br/>Same committed task history<br/>Attempts, leases and accepted grids")]
            C -->|"Apply committed commands"| QC
        end

        A <-->|"AppendEntries / durable ACK"| B
        A <-->|"AppendEntries / durable ACK"| C
    end

    W["Independent workers: 1, 2, ... N<br/>Pull one available tile at a time<br/>MandelbrotRenderer.render_tile(task)"]
    AS["One logical image assembler<br/>Color iteration counts and stitch tiles<br/>Can rebuild from committed results"]
    PNG["Final PNG"]

    UI -->|"CREATE_JOB<br/>dimensions, complex bounds,<br/>max_iterations, tile_size"| A
    A -.->|"Job status / image reference"| UI
    W -->|"REQUEST_TASK<br/>HEARTBEAT / COMPLETE_TASK"| A
    A -->|"TASK after assignment commits<br/>job settings, tile bounds,<br/>attempt, lease token + deadline"| W
    QA -->|"Leader reads all COMPLETED grids<br/>and coordinates for assembly"| AS
    AS -->|"Write image"| PNG

    classDef client fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#17243b
    classDef leader fill:#e6efff,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px,color:#123269
    classDef follower fill:#f1f5ff,stroke:#7892b8,color:#243b60
    classDef worker fill:#e4f6f1,stroke:#16856a,color:#104d40
    classDef assembler fill:#fff3d8,stroke:#b8841c,color:#674511
    classDef output fill:#17324d,stroke:#17324d,color:#ffffff
    classDef queue fill:#f1eaff,stroke:#8052b8,stroke-width:2px,color:#462a70
    class UI client
    class A leader
    class B,C follower
    class W worker
    class AS assembler
    class PNG output
    class QA,QB,QC queue
